  "provenance": "The reviewer reported target allowance for all nine hosts and quoted the HN path rules, two crawl-delay values, and MET's 404. This file models those facts for MockTransport. It contains no downloaded robots.txt bodies. Mock User-agent groups and additional Allow lines are not verbatim origin content.",
